  "scopes": {
    "assetDisplayReplay": "Extends the prior six-root optional asset topology with bounded opaque display-edge replay. Preparation retains weak owners and immutable field names only. Each checkpoint rereads live values, replays original MovieClip reference resolution and exact alias/error order, and skips only freshly recognized explicit opaque constructors. Ordinary/namespace overlaps and unsupported states retain the unchanged fresh BFS. Read-only nested assetIndex status adds no traversal or native work.",
    "webglReadbackAllocation": "Only wasm WebGL Rgba8Unorm NotCopied bitmap capture may replace a pooled MAP_READ buffer when its allocation exceeds twice the requested padded size and the excess is at least256KiB. Return the pooled guard before allocating an exact call-local COPY_DST|MAP_READ buffer; retain the original rectangle, row layout, submission, synchronous capture, unmap and copy-count sequence. Other backends, formats, AlreadyCopied and ordinary pool policy remain unchanged. No persistent cache is added."
